- **01-source**: 20+ files (PRD, flow diagrams, SOW, WBS, proposals)
- **02-domain**: 50+ files (~15,000 lines)
- **03-module-specifications**: 50+ files, 14 modules (~20,000 lines)
- **04-backlog**: 140+ files (98+ stories, 4 sprints, sprint tasks)
- **05-architecture**: 90+ files (~12,000 lines) - includes Django architecture
- **06-contracts**: 25+ files (API/event contracts, meeting notes)
- **07-reference**: 10+ files (data dictionaries, reference materials)
- **08-change-requests**: 5 files
- **09-development-guides**: 46 files (~8,000 lines) - backend implementation
- **10-meta**: 22+ files (1 archive, 4 plans, 16 reports, 3 tracking)
- **11-design-system**: 12 files (design tokens, components, patterns, platforms)
- **12-e2e-testing**: 15 files (foundation, master data, users)

### Key Metrics:
- **User Stories**: 98+ (US-001 to US-098+)
